{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/al-raha-lofts-1-reportage-properties-al-raha-beach","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":515,"crm_id":"234","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Al Raha Lofts 1","slug":"al-raha-lofts-1-reportage-properties-al-raha-beach","display_address":"Al Raha Beach","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Reportage Properties","price":1012500,"display_price":"1.01M","lattitude":24.4494219,"longitude":54.6062922,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Al Raha Lofts 1 is a contemporary 6 story-high residential community, which offers the best mix of<strong> studio, one, two, and three-bedroom apartments </strong>with the canal view, landscape, swimming pools, sports court, retail shops, and restaurants.</p><p>In a blend of contemporary art and a beautiful reflection of the water canal, Al Raha Lofts 1 stand out as an unparalleled community of Italian beauty. With modern facades and high-quality finishing, Al Raha Lofts 1 never fails to impress and meet every refined taste. This concrete beauty glows in a light color palette, with double-glazed glass exteriors that reflect the water views and add an elegant modern touch.</p><p>Al Raha Lofts 1 offers our signature lofts design, with modern and contemporary look, to create the perfect blend of modernity and simplicity of nature, with full amenities, gymnasium, swimming pool and private jacuzzies. From the high-quality finishing and the light colour palette to the modern Italian furnishing, every bit of space is an artwork in itself, that speaks of modernity, serenity and all what art feels like, with balconies and terraces on a serene view of life.</p><p>Along the highway to Dubai, lies one of the most picturesque spots called Al Raha Beach. Neighbouring Abu Dhabi Airport, Yas Island, and Khalifa City, Al Raha Beach became one of the most sought-after destinations and a diamond that shone on the map of suburban communities. In such a self-contained city with full amenities and an inspiring lifestyle, one can only expect relaxation, serenity, and a community to belong to.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/234/images/2024/04/04/KxQZthlTr0QVqWIUebn9iRAwJk7Jh31B5xt44ASX.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/04/KxQZthlTr0QVqWIUebn9iRAwJk7Jh31B5xt44ASX.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/234/images/2024/04/04/NnBWVwQrHMpIDMWLiylm5FAtv1s7H4eaj9a9mhxV.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/04/NnBWVwQrHMpIDMWLiylm5FAtv1s7H4eaj9a9mhxV.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/234/images/2024/04/04/Hoqbrt3CUxn9bzi2hIxpZ2uReprr2EB35Uyrk5mD.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/04/Hoqbrt3CUxn9bzi2hIxpZ2uReprr2EB35Uyrk5mD.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/234/images/2024/04/04/oieAJvlDgAjlCafrpclEwMKF1KbIaoJEvVLD3tq6.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/04/oieAJvlDgAjlCafrpclEwMKF1KbIaoJEvVLD3tq6.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/234/images/2024/04/04/Ibg3bym9cisMkQ9qTzhRhtfVjYKBepZEwQyTVdy2.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/04/Ibg3bym9cisMkQ9qTzhRhtfVjYKBepZEwQyTVdy2.jpg","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/234/images/2024/04/04/Nn1qPEnnwRLEcDpptgtjIh2PRmsjk6tu2qvoA9y4.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/04/Nn1qPEnnwRLEcDpptgtjIh2PRmsjk6tu2qvoA9y4.jpg","__ggfxIndex":5}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":1941,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"i